  "description": "Circuit-level design of linear voltage regulators that convert filtered but unregulated DC into a stable, low-noise output rail. Covers zener shunt references, series pass-transistor (emitter-follower) regulators, and low-dropout (LDO) topologies, with thermal design (power dissipation, heatsink sizing, thermal resistance). Owns the circuit-design pedagogy; system-level regulator manufacturing is covered by power-electronics.",
